# Schneekugel shard: a broken piece of the snow globe's glass (w lit edge,
# h body, i edge on the shadow side) with a k outline and a fleck of snow.
# The renderer spawns 4 when a globe shatters (wall, stomp, axe), like
# brick debris. spin: frame 0 = a thin tilted sliver, frame 1 = a short
# curved piece (not a rotation of frame 0); the snow fleck (w in a k ring)
# sits apart from the point and swaps corners.
sprite = schneekugel_scherben
size   = 8x8
origin = 4,8
hitbox = 1,1,6,6
anim   = spin frames=2 ticks=4 loop
---
frame spin 0
.k......
kwk..kk.
.k..kwhk
...kwhik
..kwhik.
.kwhik..
.kiik...
..kk....
frame spin 1
........
..kkk...
.kwwhkk.
kwhhhiik
.kiiikk.
..kkk.k.
.....kwk
......k.
